{"kind": "mod", "id": 716, "name": "Snofielf's Balanced Night Vision", "slug": "snofielfs-balanced-night-vision", "teaser": "NVGs that dont suck!", "owner_name": "Snofielf", "downloads": 13552, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:42.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-01-19T04:11:10.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-01-19T04:11:10.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.7.0", "latest_version": "1.0.13", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/ncsa/", "description_html": "<p><strong>YOU NEED <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/813-amands-s-graphics/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AMAND’S GRAPHICS</a> INSTALLED IF YOU WANT YOUR GAME TO LOOK BETTER WITH MY MOD AND CONFIG</strong></p>\n<p><strong>DON’T BITCH AT ME IF Y’AINT GOT <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/813-amands-s-graphics/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">IT</a> INSTALLED AND IT LOOKS LIKE SHIT</strong> Because I keep forgetting that Thermals are changed with this mod,</p>\n<p><strong>ANY MOD THAT FUCKS WITH THERMALS WILL NOT WORK WITH SBNV</strong></p>\n<p><strong>YES, YOU CAN TURN THE MOTION BLUR OFF, READ THE BLUE TEXT BELOW<br />\nYES, THIS IS TARKIE MENU AND KMC GEAR COMPATIBLE<br />\nShoutout to SSH for helping out with bundle work!<br />\nShoutout to Borkel for his code to change the masks!</strong></p>\n<p>Enjoy Night Raids? Dont enjoy BSG nods? Say less.</p>\n<p>I use motion blur enabled with my Amand’s Setup. <strong>Cry about it.</strong> In my opinion, Amand’s Motion Blur makes Tarkov look way better since it runs like ass for most people, but since opinions aren’t facts, <strong>you can turn it off by ticking the Advanced Options checkbox in your F12 Menu and turning the instances of it off in the ‘Graphics’ Tab in the</strong> <em><strong>same menu</strong></em>.</p>\n<p>This is just a tweak of Props’ reupload of JC980s mod, found <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/884-modular-nvgs-updated/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>.<br />\nMask code generously borrowed from Borkel’s mod of this mod, found <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1303-borkel-s-realistic-night-vision-goggles-nvg/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.9", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 887, "published_at": "2023-10-24T10:27:16.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/716/snofielfs-balanced-night-vision/1.0.9", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.11", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.2", "content_length": null, "downloads": 283, "published_at": "2023-11-19T03:55:24.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/716/snofielfs-balanced-night-vision/1.0.11", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.12", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 679, "published_at": "2023-11-21T02:37:11.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/716/snofielfs-balanced-night-vision/1.0.12", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.13", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.7.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1315, "published_at": "2024-01-10T09:39:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/716/snofielfs-balanced-night-vision/1.0.13", "git